### What I work on

**Enterprise & Data Center Networking**
MPLS WANs, VXLAN/EVPN fabrics, Cumulus Linux deployments across field sites and head office infrastructure.

**Network Security & Assessment**
Active Directory hardening, wireless and WAN exposure analysis, vulnerable-AD lab work (pfSense/Snort, Wazuh, Kali Purple).

**Automation & Visibility**
Python tooling for network diagnostics and monitoring — route classification, ARP/HSRP/VRRP pattern matching, custom platforms.

### Featured project

> **[LNMP — Linux Network Monitoring Platform](#)**
> FastAPI · TimescaleDB · Vue — built as both a production tool and a structured Python-learning project.

### Background

Electrical & Computer Engineering roots, now anchored in network engineering and cybersecurity. I write about breach analysis, lab builds, and infrastructure design, with a bias toward empirical over theoretical.

